// QA
"What should my odometer read?" = "我的里程表应该显示多少？";
"Your odometer should read less than %@." = "你的里程表读数应该小于 %@。";
"To calculate the result, we take the number of miles you're allowed to drive each day according to your lease agreement and multiply it by the number of days that have passed since the lease started. Then we add the starting mileage to that total." = "为了计算结果，我们会根据你的租赁协议计算出每天允许驾驶的里程，并将其乘以租赁开始以来经过的天数。最后将初始里程加到该总额中。";

"How far can I drive today?" = "我今天还能开多远？";
"You can drive as far as you want because you did not set the mileage allowed." = "因为你没有设置允许的里程上限，所以你今天想开多远都可以。";
"You can drive up to %@ %@ today and still be on track." = "你今天最多还可以驾驶 %@ %@ 以保持在目标范围内。";
"To determine if the car has exceeded the maximum mileage allowed, we subtract the current mileage from the maximum allowable mileage." = "为了确定车辆是否超过了允许的最大里程，我们从最大允许里程中减去当前里程。";

"When does my lease expire?" = "我的租赁什么时候到期？";
"Congratulations, your lease is expired." = "恭喜，你的租赁已到期。";
"You have %@ months left. Keep up the work!" = "你还剩下 %@ 个月。继续保持！";
"To calculate the remaining lease duration, we subtract the number of months that have passed since the lease started from the total length of the lease." = "为了计算剩余的租赁时长，我们从租赁总长度中减去自租赁开始以来已经经过的月数。";

